{"t":"Hiding the Amulet (Book)","s":"hiding-the-amulet-book-53bcc","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Paper_Object_21b311.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Piece of Paper (Object)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Paper_Object_21b311.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Below the <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%27s%20Outpost\">Adventurer's Outpost</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">An adventurer hides an ancient amulet just before his death.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dormovo the Impetuous</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mr%20Morris\">Mr Morris</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/dawnport-quest\">Dawnport Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Dawnport Libraries.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.55<br/>September 15, 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>(You can barely read the following words on this soiled piece of paper)<br/><br/>\n</p><p>... growing weaker by the minute. I should have... bad feeling about this!<br/>\nThe cyclops ...<br/>\n... too many of them. No help. I must...<br/>\n... hid the ancient amulet beneath the sand, before ...should have listened to ...<br/>\nMust hide... paper, hope an adventurer will...<br/><br/><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n... amulet will be washed ashore if not found...<br/>\nTo any adventurer friend: ... shovel... beach...<br/>\n.. dig there. ... take it to Morris, maybe he ... decipher the engravings.<br/><br/>\n</p><p>Signed<br/>\n</p><p>\nDormovo the Impetuous</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["dawnport-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"dawnport-quest","quest":"Dawnport Quest","step":"1-1","n":3,"title":"Encontrar o esqueleto","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32047,"y":31914,"z":7,"label":"Esqueleto com o papel"}]}]}}